NAME
     service - start and stop services

SYNOPSIS
     service NAME start|stop|restart|reload|status
     update-rc.d NAME defaults|remove|enable|disable

DESCRIPTION
     service runs /etc/init.d/NAME with the action given. Called as
     update-rc.d it makes or removes the links under /etc/rc.d that
     decide what starts at boot.

SEE ALSO
     init(8), telinit(8), start-stop-daemon(8)
